String Rotation
Right Rotation
hello ->rotation by 1 -> ohell
string rr_S=S.substr(index,length)

N=length of String
k=Rotation value
string rr_S=S.substr(N-K,k)+S.substr(0,N-K); //before this take modulo

Left Rotation
string lr_S=S.substr(k,N-k)+S.substr(0,K);


